(ACME PETROCHEMICAL DEMO COMPLEX | STD-ENG-014 \(Rev R1\) | Page 1 of 4) Tj
0 -28 Td
(==============================================================================) Tj
T*
(ACME PETROCHEMICAL DEMO COMPLEX - CORPORATE ENGINEERING STANDARD) Tj
T*
(DOCUMENT CODE: STD-ENG-014 | REVISION: R1) Tj
T*
(TITLE: OVERPRESSURE PROTECTION, PSV SIZING & FLARE HEADER HYDRAULICS \(API 520 / API 521 / DIERS\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. MANDATORY SET PRESSURE & ACCUMULATION LIMITS \(ASME SECTION VIII DIV. 1\)) Tj
T*
(- Single PSV \(Non-Fire Contingency\): Set pressure <= 100% of authoritative Equipment Internal Design Pressure \(MAWP\); maximum accumulation = 10%.) Tj
T*
(- Dual/Multiple PSVs: Primary PSV set pressure <= 100% of lowest authoritative Equipment Design Pressure; maximum accumulation = 16%.) Tj
T*
(- External Fire Contingency: Maximum accumulation = 21% above MAWP.) Tj
T*
(- Governance Rule on Conflicting Design Pressures: Where a P&ID and Process Data Sheet exhibit a discrepancy \(e.g., D-2304 showing 11.0 kg/cm2g on DS-D2304 vs 12.2 kg/cm2g on PID-23-0013\), the PSV set pressure MUST be governed by the lower conservative rating \(11.0 kg/cm2g\) until mechanical re-rating is certified.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
