T*
(STD-ENG-014 PAGE 2 OF 4 - DIERS TWO-PHASE REACTIVE RUNAWAY SIZING) Tj
T*
(- Reactive Peroxide Systems \(Unit 2300 V-2301 & D-2304\):) Tj
T*
(  * Relief valves protecting vessels containing > 5 wt% Cumene Hydroperoxide \(CHP\) must be sized for homogeneous two-phase vapor-liquid flashing flow using the Leung Omega method \(DIERS\).) Tj
T*
(  * PSV-2304A/B on D-2304 requires API 526 Orifice 4J6 \(8.303 cm2\) to pass 38,400 kg/hr two-phase flow at 11.0 kg/cm2g set pressure.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
