T*
(STD-ENG-014 PAGE 3 OF 4 - INLET PRESSURE DROP & BACKPRESSURE LIMITS) Tj
T*
(- Inlet Piping Pressure Drop: Must not exceed 3.0% of set pressure at rated capacity \(requires 6 in short-coupled inlet nozzle N6 on D-2304\).) Tj
T*
(- Balanced Bellows Backpressure Limit: Total superimposed + built-up backpressure in header 8"-PR-2320-316L to D-2320 must not exceed 30% of set pressure \(actual = 10.5%\).) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
