(STD-ENG-014 PAGE 4 OF 4 - FLARE KNOCK-OUT DRUM SIZING CRITERIA) Tj
T*
(- Knock-Out Drum D-2320 must separate liquid droplets >= 300 microns and provide 20 minutes of emergency liquid holdup from the largest single relief event.) Tj
